================================================================================
2. OPTIONAL EXTERNAL TOOLS (NOT EMBEDDED, NOT LINKED)
================================================================================

tyto can orchestrate the following third-party tools when they are present on
the host. They are executed as independent operating-system processes via the
shell / exec. tyto does NOT bundle, statically link, or redistribute them, and
their code is never compiled into the tyto binary. Each tool remains governed
solely by its own license; obtaining and using these tools is the operator's
responsibility.

nuclei-templates (ProjectDiscovery)
    License: MIT
    Used as a data set (YAML templates) cloned by the operator; read at
    runtime, not embedded.

searchsploit / Exploit-DB (OffSec)
    License: GPL-2.0 (searchsploit tool); the Exploit-DB content carries its
    own per-entry terms. Invoked as an external command.

NetExec (formerly CrackMapExec / crackmapexec)
    License: BSD-2-Clause (NetExec). The legacy crackmapexec project was
    BSD-2-Clause as well. Invoked as an external command.

Because these tools run out-of-process and are neither linked nor
redistributed with tyto, their licenses (including any copyleft terms such as
GPL-2.0 for searchsploit) do not extend to or impose obligations on the tyto
binary. This embed-vs-shell-out boundary is intentional.
